{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00284","headline":"游长宁公主流杯池二十五首 十 · 上官昭容","name":"游长宁公主流杯池二十五首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霁晓气清和，披襟赏薜萝。\n玳瑁凝春色，琉璃漾水波。\n跂石聊长啸，攀松乍短歌。\n除非物外者，谁就此经过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官昭容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}